+description: "Records a persistence type transition and its compatibility acknowledgement."
+kind: persistence-change
+---
+
+# 2026-10-05-event-sources
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-05-event-sources.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds optional dsh.event-sources/v1 metadata to native and PTC tool results and to injected rule and skill message sources. Producers retain small provider identities, observed source versions, text references, and process outcomes without copying source bodies.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-05-event-sources
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:agent/inbox/spliced"
+    previous: "2026-09-21-user-question-reply"
+    after: "8744ec875609ce2a2d71e27ee8bc2ece44bfd2fb0adaf3c002714a1c9b37c1e5"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:developer/message"
+    previous: "2026-09-21-user-question-reply"
+    after: "63e6d0f15f0cb91b8a3f604105e5e59ccbbc132fb85b6611996926260091d3c5"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:session/title-llm-request"
+    previous: "2026-09-21-user-question-reply"
+    after: "2400d788bb5608eb1139b25096ebe0e6ce288e1999e9640f0be459d12e9cd2d3"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:tool/ptc-dispatch"
+    previous: "2026-09-16-session-format-v4"
+    after: "2affc420c822923e44f9596ca2066e52b77a94021a0dadc21b69fa0474d3ebab"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:tool/result"
+    previous: "2026-09-16-session-format-v4"
+    after: "bdd38f237a94a0e5b0d3fd808fee756d6bd3f741b17949bbb7029605d898942f"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:user/message"
+    previous: "2026-09-21-user-question-reply"
+    after: "02c967f2e12962820d3221127a7ad918a2ec2297512853e452e5b225176bc176"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+The classifier reports ten optional-property additions across six event roots and requires no writer bump. SessionHeader.version remains 4, and the accepted V4 checkpoint and historical acknowledgements remain unchanged. Existing records without eventSources remain readable and mean uncollected; readers do not infer provenance from current files. Older readers preserve or ignore the extra nested JSON while using the unchanged event envelope, source.kind, model-facing content, error fields, and presentation metadata. Failed source capture records unknown without changing native execution. The metadata does not prove skill adoption, contribution depth, or task completion.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+Direct Node Vitest runs passed 571 producer tests across eight files and 44 SDK client tests, including Session.append through native Host follow/page, JSON transport, historyEntries, and recordContext. Host targeted TypeScript checks passed. Real Agent Loop foreground bash tests passed for exit 0 and exit 9, while the native isError flag stayed unchanged. Clean pinned-upstream patch application and all patched-file hashes passed. The original JSONL first-turn fixture remains unverified because the dependency SDK lacks system.node; installed desktop capture and persistence reload are not claimed by this acknowledgement.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
