+When the tool runtime is composed, injected rule contexts may carry optional `source.eventSources` for the files actually represented in that context. Capture keeps the complete observed file digest and the renderer’s delivered prefix separately, so omitted files and undisplayed portions are not presented as delivered content. Removal may reuse only facts held by this live producer. Source lookup failure does not replace the original instruction text; missing historical metadata remains uncollected. Provider wiring and bounds are defined by [the tool runtime](../../core/tools/README.md).
